Hi, 

I've a sample of let's say 10.000 individuals and I want to work on subsamples (subsample of women, of students, etc.) with TraMineR. I'd like to know if it's possible to create a stslist object with seqdef for the whole sample (10.000) and make my selections on this object afterwards (in my workflow this would be more efficient), or do I have to create subsamples before using seqdef function ? 

Thanks, 

Hadrien 
